// Defiance County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor's Pivot Point
// site, the CourtView case search, the Board of Elections, ProMedica and the
// Tinora schools) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * ProMedica Defiance Regional Hospital moved to
//     promedica.org/defiance-regional-hospital (the old /pages/default.aspx 404s).
//   * Northeastern Local Schools (Tinora) is now tinora.org; tinora.k12.oh.us no
//     longer resolves.
//   * The ODNR Independence Dam State Park page moved to the /go-and-do/ path.
//   * The state OhioMeansJobs Defiance page is gone; the county now points to the
//     Defiance/Paulding Consolidated JFS site.
//   * The Auditor site (auditor.defiance-county.com, Pivot Point) shows a
//     "software conversion" banner; data may lag.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   hicksvillechamber.com is Hicksville, NEW YORK; the Ohio chamber is
//   hicksvilleohiochamber.org. hicksvillehistoricalsociety.org is padded with
//   gambling spam and is left out. defianceymca.thechurchco.com is a mirror.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Defiance), villages Hicksville, Sherwood and Ney (no site), and
//     twelve townships (Defiance and Noble have pages on the county site).
//   * Shared bodies: Defiance/Paulding Consolidated JFS; Four County ADAMhs Board
//     (Archbold) and Four County Career Center; the Four County Joint Solid Waste
//     District (Defiance, Fulton, Paulding, Williams), hosted by Defiance County.
//   * There is no county transit system; Senior Services gives rides to residents
//     60 and older.
//   * Johnson Memorial Library (Hicksville) is a branch of the Defiance Public
//     Library System.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Northwest State Community College: campuses in Archbold and Van Wert, none in
//     Defiance County.
//   * Defiance County Fair site shows only 2016 dates; no current site found.
//   * Land bank, port authority, regional planning commission: no websites found.
//   * Center for Child and Family Advocacy (Napoleon): its site does not name
//     Defiance County.

